// Conformance fixture for ta.crossunder (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.31, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-executing the crossunder formula against a hard-coded synthetic
// close series (see ta_crossunder.csv `close` column).
//
// crossunder is symmetric to crossover; with the same series that
// crossed *above* 104 at 2024-01-05, no downward crossing occurs — the
// series stays above 104 for the remainder. Output is false throughout.
// The presence of a permanent-false series is the point: it exercises
// the persistent-state warmup + no-crossing branch that crossover cannot.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_crossunder", overlay=false)
plot(ta.crossunder(close, 104) ? 1 : 0, title="cu")
